[[2047,15,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The diagnostic socket \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is supplied directly by the\nbattery at pin 16 by the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the\njunction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . Pins 4 and 5 are earthed.</p><p>Pin 1 is connected to the ABS control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n11) (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234769\">E7020</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>Pin 3 is connected to the Air Bag control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M60</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 9) (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234801\">E7030</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>Pin 9 is connected to the climate control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              (pin 8 of connector B) (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234632\">E6020</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>Pin 11 is connected to alarm control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n6 of connector A)  and remote control receiver \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 2)\n(see E7015 - ALARM).</p><p>Pin 8 is connected to the Code control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n5) (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234721\">E7010</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>Pin 7 is connected to engine management\ncontrol unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               via a dedicated line.</p><p>(\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234515\">E5030</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              )</p><p>(\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234559\">E5050</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              )</p>"],[2047,15,1048576,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>pin 7 is connected to the SELESPEED control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M54</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , which shares its test line with engine management\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3239528\">E7050</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><h3>Functional description</h3><p>The control unit of the AISIN electronic\nautomatic transmission \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is connected to pin 12 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (\n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3239528\">E7050</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p>"]]